<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\五島→なつみ.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\デパ地下.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ピザフェア.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ピザの箱.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Man, I ate and ate! I can't eat another bite!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"In the end, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, you sampled more than a whole serving's worth..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Having come to the pizza fair at Motoki Station, we enjoyed the sample pizzas they had prepared in large numbers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I had wondered what kind of person an Italian chef would be, but when I saw his face I finally understood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This Italian chef, he was someone who was on TV a lot.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Italian though he was, he wielded </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="りゅうちょう">fluent</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> Tsugaru dialect; he was the man of the hour, making living rooms roar with laughter with his lively talk.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He always wore a white chef's coat, but he gave off a stronger impression of a variety-show personality than of a chef.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But, since this morning's incident had happened, wouldn't this chef too find it hard to work in the mood Motoki-cho was in today?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or so I had thought, but he was a pro, just as you'd expect.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As if to smash the gloomy mood, he acted cheerful and showed off his witty talk and his smile.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">With such a popular chef coming, the pizza fair's huge success probably goes without saying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And he was a professional chef, just as you'd expect. Not only his talk, but his pizza too was superb.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Perhaps drawn along by the packed pizza fair, this whole area was noisy.</STYLE><PG>
"I made sure to get take-out ones too, so today's a really good day!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> looked very satisfied.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even though there'd been a murder like that, calling it a good day.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> looked very satisfied, but there was one big problem.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">... how are you going to carry that home?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? By bike, obviously... 
{PAUSE ""}
...or not. It won't all fit... Haha, what'll I do..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> was happily at a loss.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
<PG>
"Whoa, a call. Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, hold this for me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{MOTION "ピザ移動" "アイテム1" "3" "200" "300" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, with that, handed the pizza boxes over to me, with a thump.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ugh... pretty heavy...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, it's from somebody in my class. 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Yes, hello? Oh, what's up? Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At first she was chatting happily, but―</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
"Huh? <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Giddy until just a moment ago, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s voice suddenly changed to a tense </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こわいろ">tone</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>'s... at Zahha with a suspicious person, they said..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Don't tell me </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had caught the culprit's eye and been carried off?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But going to Zahha for that would be strange.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Or else, of all things, compensated dating?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of all people wouldn't do something like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But it was certain that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was with a suspicious man.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, can you call </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\なつみ→五島.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, sorry, it's a call."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"O-Ojisan...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hi-iii, it's Goto! What's up, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>! Are you safe!? Are you with a suspicious person right now!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Suspicious person...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I turned my eyes to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ahahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">This man</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is a police officer! A lot happened while I was at the park, and it turned out he's going to tell me about the incident!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What the heck, scaring me like that... damn, those guys and their weird info..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's really noisy on your end. Are you out somewhere?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah!<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE>I took <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> along, and this time it's the pizza fair by the station! But I bought too much, and how am I gonna carry it home..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"The moment you hear 'pizza,' you lose all restraint... At times like that, you should use the same-day delivery service at the station. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm pretty sure they'll do it for 500 yen. And don't drag </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> around too much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ooh, just what I'd expect from the genius girl <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>!<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE>You saved me! Thank you!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Still, so I'm with a suspicious person, huh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, I'd vaguely felt eyes on me for a while now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I looked out past the smoking booth, everyone quickly looked away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Okay, then, let's talk about the incident!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I flashed him a grin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face was somehow grim.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Now, now, there are days like that, so please don't be down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The one you were just talking to... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Haruka Niimura-san<STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? That's right, but... Do you know </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "50"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I thought so... </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="6">'s family had it hard, I once heard from a senior of mine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And so it was from the mouth of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, showing me a police officer's face for the first time, that I learned of the death of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">'s father.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
